nspicuouscognition.com/p/the-everyone-is-biased-bias?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.conspicuouscognition.com/p/the-everyone-is-biased-bias?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/social-learning-links-3202025">Social Learning Links, 3/20/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.conspicuouscognition.com/p/the-everyone-is-biased-bias?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.conspicuouscognition.com/p/the-everyone-is-biased-bias?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Thu, 20 Mar 2025 11:03:30 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[What Explains the Global Islamic Revival?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>What lead to the Global Islamic Revival? This was one of the most significant political movements of the 20th century, occurring across multiple world regions. The existing literature is rich, but extremely disparate and disconnected, typically focusing on local idiosyncrasies – Egypt’s economic stagnation, Turkey’s religious associations, Iran’s religious authoritarianism, Sahelian state weakness, Pakistani return migration from the Gulf, repression in Uzbekistan, Indonesian’s resistance to secular schooling. But could there be a common cause…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.ggd.world/p/what-explains-the-global-islamic?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.ggd.world/p/what-explains-the-global-islamic?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/social-learning-links-3202025">Social Learning Links, 3/20/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.ggd.world/p/what-explains-the-global-islamic?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.ggd.world/p/what-explains-the-global-islamic?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Thu, 20 Mar 2025 11:03:30 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Most Externalities are Solved with Technology, Not Coordination]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>The basic externalities story goes like this: Some things, like air quality or scientific discoveries, have effects which spread to millions of people without cost or reward to the creator. Actions with unpunished costs are over-produced and actions with uncompensated benefits are left undone…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.maximum-progress.com/p/most-externalities-are-solved-with?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.maximum-progress.com/p/most-externalities-are-solved-with?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/economics-links-12b">Economics Links, 3/19/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.maximum-progress.com/p/most-externalities-are-solved-with?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.maximum-progress.com/p/most-externalities-are-solved-with?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Wed, 19 Mar 2025 11:03:39 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Is China inventing big important things?]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>“We are amazed, but not amused” — Stevie Wonder…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.noahpinion.blog/p/is-china-inventing-big-important?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.noahpinion.blog/p/is-china-inventing-big-important?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/economics-links-12b">Economics Links, 3/19/2025</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.noahpinion.blog/p/is-china-inventing-big-important?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_ca